[
  {
    "content_id": "10050001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;基督耶稣的仆人保罗和提摩太写信给凡住腓立比、在基督耶稣里的众圣徒，和诸位监督，诸位执事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;愿恩惠、平安从　神我们的父并主耶稣基督归与你们！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我每逢想念你们，就感谢我的　神；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;每逢为你们众人祈求的时候，常是欢欢喜喜地祈求。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;因为从头一天直到如今，你们是同心合意地兴旺福音。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我深信那在你们心里动了善工的，必成全这工，直到耶稣基督的日子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;我为你们众人有这样的意念，原是应当的；因你们常在我心里，无论我是在捆锁之中，是辩明证实福音的时候，你们都与我一同得恩。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我体会基督耶稣的心肠，切切地想念你们众人；这是　神可以给我作见证的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我所祷告的，就是要你们的爱心在知识和各样见识上多而又多，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;使你们能分别是非，作诚实无过的人，直到基督的日子；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;并靠着耶稣基督结满了仁义的果子，叫荣耀称赞归与　神。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;弟兄们，我愿意你们知道，我所遭遇的事更是叫福音兴旺，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;以致我受的捆锁在御营全军和其余的人中，已经显明是为基督的缘故。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;并且那在主里的弟兄多半因我受的捆锁就笃信不疑，越发放胆传　神的道，无所惧怕。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;有的传基督是出于嫉妒纷争，也有的是出于好意。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;这一等是出于爱心，知道我是为辩明福音设立的；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;那一等传基督是出于结党，并不诚实，意思要加增我捆锁的苦楚。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;这有何妨呢？或是假意，或是真心，无论怎样，基督究竟被传开了。为此，我就欢喜，并且还要欢喜；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;因为我知道，这事借着你们的祈祷和耶稣基督之灵的帮助，终必叫我得救。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;照着我所切慕、所盼望的，没有一事叫我羞愧。只要凡事放胆，无论是生是死，总叫基督在我身上照常显大。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;因我活着就是基督，我死了就有益处。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;但我在肉身活着，若成就我工夫的果子，我就不知道该挑选什么。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;我正在两难之间，情愿离世与基督同在，因为这是好得无比的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;然而，我在肉身活着，为你们更是要紧的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;我既然这样深信，就知道仍要住在世间，且与你们众人同住，使你们在所信的道上又长进又喜乐，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001026",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;叫你们在基督耶稣里的欢乐，因我再到你们那里去，就越发加增。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001027",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:27",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001027",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>27</sup>&nbsp;只要你们行事为人与基督的福音相称，叫我或来见你们，或不在你们那里，可以听见你们的景况，知道你们同有一个心志，站立得稳，为所信的福音齐心努力。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001028",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:28",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001028",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>28</sup>&nbsp;凡事不怕敌人的惊吓，这是证明他们沉沦，你们得救都是出于　神。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001029",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:29",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001029",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>29</sup>&nbsp;因为你们蒙恩，不但得以信服基督，并要为他受苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050001030",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 1:30",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50001030",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>30</sup>&nbsp;你们的争战，就与你们在我身上从前所看见、现在所听见的一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;所以，在基督里若有什么劝勉，爱心有什么安慰，圣灵有什么交通，心中有什么慈悲怜悯，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;你们就要意念相同，爱心相同，有一样的心思，有一样的意念，使我的喜乐可以满足。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;凡事不可结党，不可贪图虚浮的荣耀；只要存心谦卑，各人看别人比自己强。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;各人不要单顾自己的事，也要顾别人的事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你们当以基督耶稣的心为心：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;他本有　神的形象， 不以自己与　神同等为强夺的；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;反倒虚己， 取了奴仆的形象， 成为人的样式；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;既有人的样子，就自己卑微， 存心顺服，以至于死， 且死在十字架上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;所以，　神将他升为至高， 又赐给他那超乎万名之上的名，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;叫一切在天上的、地上的，和地底下的， 因耶稣的名无不屈膝，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;无不口称「耶稣基督为主」， 使荣耀归与父　神。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;这样看来，我亲爱的弟兄，你们既是常顺服的，不但我在你们那里，就是我如今不在你们那里，更是顺服的，就当恐惧战兢做成你们得救的工夫。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;因为你们立志行事都是　神在你们心里运行，为要成就他的美意。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;凡所行的，都不要发怨言，起争论，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;使你们无可指摘，诚实无伪，在这弯曲悖谬的世代作　神无瑕疵的儿女。你们显在这世代中，好像明光照耀，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;将生命的道表明出来，叫我在基督的日子好夸我没有空跑，也没有徒劳。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;我以你们的信心为供献的祭物，我若被浇奠在其上，也是喜乐，并且与你们众人一同喜乐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;你们也要照样喜乐，并且与我一同喜乐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;我靠主耶稣指望快打发提摩太去见你们，叫我知道你们的事，心里就得着安慰。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;因为我没有别人与我同心，实在挂念你们的事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;别人都求自己的事，并不求耶稣基督的事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;但你们知道提摩太的明证；他兴旺福音，与我同劳，待我像儿子待父亲一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;所以，我一看出我的事要怎样了结，就盼望立刻打发他去；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;但我靠着主自信我也必快去。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;然而，我想必须打发以巴弗提到你们那里去。他是我的兄弟，与我一同做工，一同当兵，是你们所差遣的，也是供给我需用的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002026",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;他很想念你们众人，并且极其难过，因为你们听见他病了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002027",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:27",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002027",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>27</sup>&nbsp;他实在是病了，几乎要死；然而　神怜恤他，不但怜恤他，也怜恤我，免得我忧上加忧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002028",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:28",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002028",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>28</sup>&nbsp;所以我越发急速打发他去，叫你们再见他，就可以喜乐，我也可以少些忧愁。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002029",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:29",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002029",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>29</sup>&nbsp;故此，你们要在主里欢欢乐乐地接待他，而且要尊重这样的人；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050002030",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 2:30",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50002030",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>30</sup>&nbsp;因他为做基督的工夫，几乎至死，不顾性命，要补足你们供给我的不及之处。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;弟兄们，我还有话说，你们要靠主喜乐。我把这话再写给你们，于我并不为难，于你们却是妥当。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;应当防备犬类，防备作恶的，防备妄自行割的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;因为真受割礼的，乃是我们这以　神的灵敬拜、在基督耶稣里夸口、不靠着肉体的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;其实，我也可以靠肉体；若是别人想他可以靠肉体，我更可以靠着了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;我第八天受割礼；我是以色列族、便雅悯支派的人，是希伯来人所生的希伯来人。就律法说，我是法利赛人；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;就热心说，我是逼迫教会的；就律法上的义说，我是无可指摘的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;只是我先前以为与我有益的，我现在因基督都当作有损的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;不但如此，我也将万事当作有损的，因我以认识我主基督耶稣为至宝。我为他已经丢弃万事，看作粪土，为要得着基督；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;并且得以在他里面，不是有自己因律法而得的义，乃是有信基督的义，就是因信　神而来的义，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;使我认识基督，晓得他复活的大能，并且晓得和他一同受苦，效法他的死，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;或者我也得以从死里复活。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;这不是说我已经得着了，已经完全了；我乃是竭力追求，或者可以得着基督耶稣所以得着我的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;弟兄们，我不是以为自己已经得着了；我只有一件事，就是忘记背后，努力面前的，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;向着标竿直跑，要得　神在基督耶稣里从上面召我来得的奖赏。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;所以我们中间，凡是完全人总要存这样的心；若在什么事上存别样的心，　神也必以此指示你们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;然而，我们到了什么地步，就当照着什么地步行。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;弟兄们，你们要一同效法我，也当留意看那些照我们榜样行的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;因为有许多人行事是基督十字架的仇敌。我屡次告诉你们，现在又流泪地告诉你们：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 3:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;他们的结局就是沉沦；他们的神就是自己的肚腹。他们以自己的羞辱为荣耀，专以地上的事为念。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 3:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;我们却是天上的国民，并且等候救主，就是主耶稣基督从天上降临。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050003021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 3:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50003021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;他要按着那能叫万有归服自己的大能，将我们这卑贱的身体改变形状，和他自己荣耀的身体相似。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我所亲爱、所想念的弟兄们，你们就是我的喜乐，我的冠冕。我亲爱的弟兄，你们应当靠主站立得稳。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我劝友阿蝶和循都基，要在主里同心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我也求你这真实同负一轭的，帮助这两个女人，因为她们在福音上曾与我一同劳苦；还有革利免，并其余和我一同做工的，他们的名字都在生命册上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;你们要靠主常常喜乐。我再说，你们要喜乐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;当叫众人知道你们谦让的心。主已经近了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;应当一无挂虑，只要凡事借着祷告、祈求，和感谢，将你们所要的告诉　神。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;神所赐、出人意外的平安必在基督耶稣里保守你们的心怀意念。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;弟兄们，我还有未尽的话：凡是真实的、可敬的、公义的、清洁的、可爱的、有美名的，若有什么德行，若有什么称赞，这些事你们都要思念。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;你们在我身上所学习的，所领受的，所听见的，所看见的，这些事你们都要去行，赐平安的　神就必与你们同在。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我靠主大大地喜乐，因为你们思念我的心如今又发生；你们向来就思念我，只是没得机会。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我并不是因缺乏说这话；我无论在什么景况都可以知足，这是我已经学会了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我知道怎样处卑贱，也知道怎样处丰富；或饱足，或饥饿；或有余，或缺乏，随事随在，我都得了秘诀。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;我靠着那加给我力量的，凡事都能做。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;然而，你们和我同受患难原是美事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;腓立比人哪，你们也知道我初传福音离了马其顿的时候，论到授受的事，除了你们以外，并没有别的教会供给我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;就是我在帖撒罗尼迦，你们也一次两次地打发人供给我的需用。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 4:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;我并不求什么馈送，所求的就是你们的果子渐渐增多，归在你们的帐上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 4:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;但我样样都有，并且有余。我已经充足，因我从以巴弗提受了你们的馈送，当作极美的香气，为　神所收纳、所喜悦的祭物。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 4:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;我的　神必照他荣耀的丰富，在基督耶稣里，使你们一切所需用的都充足。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 4:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;愿荣耀归给我们的父　神，直到永永远远。阿们！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10050004021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "腓立比书 4:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "50004021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;请问在基督耶稣里的各位圣徒安。在我这里的众弟兄都问你们安。</p>"
  },
  {
